Output demo-real.mp4  # then docs/demo/make_gif.sh
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1400
Set Height 860
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Hide
Type `clear && claude --settings '{"language":"English"}' --permission-mode default --allowedTools "mcp__appfactory__*"` Enter
Sleep 12s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "Find an underserved iOS niche around water tracking and validate it. Keep the answer short."
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 75s
